:: MP Keepsake Use Whistle 4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>海雾与雨丝交织的雾角灯塔断桅滩外礁，<<else>>退潮时分的雾角灯塔断桅滩引航石柱前，<</if>>你取出贴身收藏的守塔人铜哨，发现石柱背风侧新露出一道与哨尾螺纹严丝合缝的青铜共鸣筒，旁边的礁石凹槽里还压着一只防水鲸油小罐。<<if $mpKeepsake and $mpKeepsake["keepsake_foghorn_whistle"]>>铜哨表面的双锚纹在海风中微微发凉。<</if>>

<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:12)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 12>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpKs4_whistle is 1>>
断桅滩外礁的青铜共鸣筒今日已借守塔人铜哨开启过，潮音悠长。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-keepsake-use-whistle-4">
<<keepsakeicon>><<link "旋入共鸣筒 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-whistle-4">>
<<if ($swimmingskill or 0) gte 250 or ($history or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpKs4_whistle to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks4_whistle_rew")>><<money 420>>共鸣筒受哨音激荡缓缓滑开底盖，吐出一卷早年灯塔长老封存的海事津贴银币。<<else>>共鸣筒内壁发出低沉醇厚的回响，替你驱散了海雾带来的寒意。<</if>><span class="green">你借守塔人铜哨唤醒了外礁共鸣筒。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回雾角岛 (0:12)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<<else>>
	海浪拍上礁盘溅湿了共鸣筒口，哨音一时被浪声盖过。<span class="red">你退上半级干礁甩去水珠。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[矮身再旋入共鸣筒 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Whistle 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回雾角岛 (0:12)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpwatchicon>><<link "滴油润哨 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-whistle-4">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 240 or ($science or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpKs4_whistle to 1>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["clue_ks4_whistle"]>><<set $mpClues["clue_ks4_whistle"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks4_whistle_rew_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>螺纹严丝合缝地锁紧，石柱侧面的暗龛随之弹开，露出一袋未动过的远洋引航铜章。<<else>>哨尾螺纹顺滑如新，吹出的长音在海雾间传出极远。<</if>><span class="green">你用鲸油养护法完整开启了外礁暗龛。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<skulduggery 1>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回雾角栈桥 (0:12)|MP Region Foghorn Pier]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<<else>>
	鲸油受海风吹拂略有些凝滞，涂抹时不够均匀。<span class="red">你用指腹温热油罐后再试。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[敛息再滴油润哨 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Whistle 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回雾角岛 (0:12)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>
<br>
<<beachicon>><<link [[继续查探 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Whistle 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Keepsake Use Core 4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night">>深夜的机括城蒸汽压力室主仪表台前，<<else>>机括城中央差分机室的副校验台前，<</if>>你取出精密运转的蓝钢怀表芯，对准校验台中央那枚缺少基准振子的黄铜共振座，座旁还摆着一把消磁铜镊与一叠空白穿孔卡。<<if $mpKeepsake and $mpKeepsake["keepsake_clockwork_core"]>>蓝钢游丝正以每秒五次的频率稳定搏动。<</if>>

<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:08)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity]]>><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpKs4_core is 1>>
差分机副校验台的黄铜共振座今日已借蓝钢怀表芯同步完毕。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-keepsake-use-core-4">
<<keepsakeicon>><<link "装入表芯 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-core-4">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 260 or ($maths or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpKs4_core to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks4_core_rew")>><<money 440>>差分机齿轮群随之整齐划一地咬合，出卡槽吐出一叠可兑付的机括城工坊银券。<<else>>共振座与怀表芯严密同步，整排黄铜算珠发出悦耳的轻响。<</if>><span class="green">你用蓝钢怀表芯校准了差分机副共振座。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回机括城 (0:08)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<<else>>
	共振座边缘的余磁让铜镊轻轻颤了一下，表芯没能一次落槽。<span class="red">你稳住手腕先把铜镊消磁。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[压手再装入表芯 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Core 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回机括城 (0:08)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpsmokeicon>><<link "调准摆频 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-core-4">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($english or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpKs4_core to 1>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["clue_ks4_core"]>><<set $mpClues["clue_ks4_core"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks4_core_rew_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>穿孔针精准打出一排基准孔位，底部的备用金盒应声弹开，奉上一笔精密校验母模。<<else>>穿孔卡完整记下了标准摆频，你将其妥善收入贴身内袋。<</if>><span class="green">你借怀表芯摆频制成了标准校验穿孔卡。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<skulduggery 1>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回齿轮回廊 (0:08)|MP Region Clockwork Corridor]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<<else>>
	穿孔卡进纸滑轨略紧，卡角微微翘起半分。<span class="red">你抚平卡角重新放回滑轨。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[沉肩再调准摆频 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Core 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回机括城 (0:08)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>
<br>
<<mpclockworkicon>><<link [[继续查探 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Core 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Keepsake Use Ring 4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night" or Time.dayState is "dusk">>暮色深沉的古修道院静默石阶底层圣龛前，<<else>>长明烛光映照的古修道院告解回音壁密龛前，<</if>>你戴上那枚雕刻着展翅白鸽的修道院银鸽指环，发现密龛石壁的浮雕圣爵中央有一处内凹的指环印槽，旁边托盘里放着一小块白蜂蜡与软鹿皮。<<if $mpKeepsake and $mpKeepsake["keepsake_abbey_ring"]>>银鸽羽翼的细纹与石壁印槽分毫不差。<</if>>

<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:08)|MP Region Sunken Abbey]]>><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpKs4_ring is 1>>
告解密龛的浮雕圣爵印槽今日已核验完毕，烛火宁静温暖。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-keepsake-use-ring-4">
<<keepsakeicon>><<link "擦亮指环 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-ring-4">>
<<if ($history or 0) gte 250 or ($willpower or 0) gte 420>>
	<<set $daily.mpKs4_ring to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks4_ring_rew")>><<money 430>>石雕圣爵向内轻陷半寸，下方暗格滑出一只装着修会古银币与圣咏残卷的丝绒袋。<<else>>指环与圣爵浮雕严丝合缝，石壁间传来一声轻柔的机括叹息。<</if>><span class="green">你凭银鸽指环开启了圣爵浮雕暗格。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回修道院 (0:08)|MP Region Sunken Abbey]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<<else>>
	石槽内积着薄薄一层香灰，指环按入时差了一丝深度。<span class="red">你轻轻吹净槽内香灰。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[俯身再擦亮指环 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Ring 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回修道院 (0:08)|MP Region Sunken Abbey]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<mptranslateicon>><<link "熔蜡拓印 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-ring-4">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpKs4_ring to 1>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["clue_ks4_ring"]>><<set $mpClues["clue_ks4_ring"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks4_ring_rew_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>合印成型的瞬间，托盘底部的平衡簧片弹开，露出一叠修道院古修会封章。<<else>>白蜂蜡合印纹路清晰优美，让你对修会早年的信物规制了然于胸。<</if>><span class="green">银鸽指环与圣爵的合印清晰地落在蜂蜡上。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<skulduggery 1>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回静默石阶 (0:08)|MP Region Abbey Steps]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<<else>>
	蜂蜡温度稍高了一点，边缘略有些化开。<span class="red">你待蜂蜡稍凉定型后再试。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[凝神再熔蜡拓印 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Ring 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回修道院 (0:08)|MP Region Sunken Abbey]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>
<br>
<<mpcleanicon>><<link [[继续查探 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Ring 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Keepsake Use Amber 4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>细雨敲打着秘密温室玻璃穹顶的弧形天窗，<<else>>暖雾萦绕的秘密温室雾化兰花厅深处，<</if>>你捧出温润剔透的琥珀香膏瓶，走近花厅核心处那座闭合的琉璃育种钟罩，钟罩底座设有微孔熏香槽与一盏可调温的酒精微火灯。<<if $mpKeepsake and $mpKeepsake["keepsake_glasshouse_amber"]>>瓶中的冷香精粹正散发着幽雅的银丝兰气息。<</if>>

<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:08)|MP Region Glasshouse Manor]]>><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpKs4_amber is 1>>
琉璃育种钟罩今日已受琥珀香膏熏染，罩内奇花舒展如初。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-keepsake-use-amber-4">
<<keepsakeicon>><<link "抹入香膏 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-amber-4">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 260 or ($science or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpKs4_amber to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks4_amber_rew")>><<money 450>>奇花花瓣随香气缓缓舒展，底座收藏格应声弹开，露出一袋温室主人留下的品鉴礼金。<<else>>幽香在琉璃钟罩内盈盈流转，沁人心脾的芬芳驱散了你的疲惫。<</if>><span class="green">你用琥珀香膏唤醒了琉璃钟罩内的珍稀兰株。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回温室 (0:08)|MP Region Glasshouse Manor]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<<else>>
	花厅喷雾刚巧洒过，微孔熏香槽沾了水汽略显潮湿。<span class="red">你拿干棉布吸干槽口水汽。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[蹲身再抹入香膏 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Amber 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回温室 (0:08)|MP Region Glasshouse Manor]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<gardenicon "water">><<link "隔水慢熏 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-amber-4">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250 or ($seductionskill or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpKs4_amber to 1>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["clue_ks4_amber"]>><<set $mpClues["clue_ks4_amber"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks4_amber_rew_alt")>><<set $mpHerbsCollected to ($mpHerbsCollected or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得草药 ×1</span>温润香雾顺导管升起，钟罩侧面的金丝暗扣滑开，奉上一封名流花会的特邀沙龙花牌。<<else>>隔水慢熏的香气醇厚绵长，整座花厅都萦绕着令人安心的暖香。<</if>><span class="green">你以隔水慢熏法激发了琥珀香膏的深层幽香。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<skulduggery 1>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回兰花厅 (0:08)|MP Region Glasshouse Orchid]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<<else>>
	酒精灯芯挑得略高，热气升得急了些。<span class="red">你用银镊把灯芯拨低半分。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[顺势再隔水慢熏 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Amber 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回温室 (0:08)|MP Region Glasshouse Manor]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>
<br>
<<windowicon>><<link [[继续查探 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Amber 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Keepsake Use Medal 4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night" or Time.dayState is "dusk">>暮色四合的黑铁货运站三号装甲货车厢内，<<else>>黑铁货运站信号塔二楼的精密联锁盘前，<</if>>你取出沉甸甸的站长纪念铜章，发现装甲车厢首端的主保险柜门上有一处八角形母印槽，旁边挂着一把铜丝刷与一只备用压力铅封钳。<<if $mpKeepsake and $mpKeepsake["keepsake_blackiron_medal"]>>铜章背面的蒸汽机车浮雕棱角分明。<</if>>

<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:10)|MP Region Blackiron Yard]]>><<pass 10>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpKs4_medal is 1>>
装甲车厢首端的八角母印槽今日已核验开启，柜门稳固锁合。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-keepsake-use-medal-4">
<<keepsakeicon>><<link "按入铜章 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-medal-4">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 260 or ($physique or 10000) gte 11500>>
	<<set $daily.mpKs4_medal to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks4_medal_rew")>><<money 460>>主保险柜内锁咔哒弹开，里面放着一匣铁路稽查处封存的特别差旅津贴。<<else>>纪念铜章与八角母槽严密咬合，机括联锁声沉稳有力。<</if>><span class="green">你凭站长纪念铜章打开了装甲车厢主保险柜。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回黑铁货站 (0:10)|MP Region Blackiron Yard]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
<<else>>
	母印槽边角残留着一点干结的石蜡，阻碍了铜章压到底。<span class="red">你用铜丝刷刮去残余石蜡。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[擦手再按入铜章 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Medal 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回黑铁货站 (0:10)|MP Region Blackiron Yard]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<crimeicon "black box">><<link "压出锡印 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-medal-4">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 250 or ($maths or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpKs4_medal to 1>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["clue_ks4_medal"]>><<set $mpClues["clue_ks4_medal"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks4_medal_rew_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>通关锡印嵌入副槽，侧面的押运结算箱随之滑开，露出一叠高额货运纪念铜章钞。<<else>>通关锡印字迹端正清晰，凭此印记可在盲段股道畅行无阻。<</if>><span class="green">你用站长纪念铜章压制了标准通关锡印。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<skulduggery 1>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回机车侧线 (0:10)|MP Region Blackiron Siding]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
<<else>>
	锡片夹得稍偏了半毫米，压出的边缘不够齐整。<span class="red">你换上一片新锡片放正。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[屏息再压出锡印 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Medal 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回黑铁货站 (0:10)|MP Region Blackiron Yard]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>
<br>
<<mpcookicon>><<link [[继续查探 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Medal 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Keepsake Use Antler 4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night" or Weather.precipitation is "rain">>雨雾漫过古德鲁伊石环的古根地穴入口，<<else>>晨光穿透林叶洒在古德鲁伊石环的迷雾石柱群间，<</if>>你取出温润洁白的白鹿角坠饰，发现正北主石柱的月相浮雕下有一道分叉形的骨槽，石台边摆着一碗山泉水与一束干艾草。坠饰中空，侧面开着两枚细小的音孔。<<if $mpKeepsake and $mpKeepsake["keepsake_druid_antler"]>>鹿角坠饰的天然分叉正好与主石柱骨槽吻合。<</if>>

<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:12)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 12>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpKs4_antler is 1>>
正北主石柱的月相骨槽今日已与白鹿角坠共鸣完毕，林风清朗。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-keepsake-use-antler-4">
<<keepsakeicon>><<link "嵌入鹿角 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-antler-4">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 260 or ($history or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpKs4_antler to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks4_antler_rew")>><<money 440>>主石柱底部发出一声低沉嗡鸣，暗格滑出一只装满猎人行会古银币与琥珀珠的皮袋。<<else>>清泉映着洁白的鹿角坠饰，石柱周围的林雾仿佛都随之澄澈了几分。<</if>><span class="green">你用白鹿角坠唤醒了主石柱的月相暗格。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回古石环 (0:12)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<<else>>
	骨槽边缘长着一圈细密青苔，嵌入时略有些打滑。<span class="red">你拨开槽边湿苔稳住手指。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[缓步再嵌入鹿角 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Antler 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回古石环 (0:12)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpanimalicon>><<link "熏暖鹿角 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-antler-4">>
<<if ($willpower or 0) gte 420 or ($athletics or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpKs4_antler to 1>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["clue_ks4_antler"]>><<set $mpClues["clue_ks4_antler"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks4_antler_rew_alt")>><<set $mpHerbsCollected to ($mpHerbsCollected or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得草药 ×1</span>清越鹿鸣穿透林雾，树冠上的守林信鸽落下一只绑着林务官酬贵宾铜牌的铜管。<<else>>艾草清香混着悠远鹿鸣在林间回荡，令你周身倦意一扫而空。<</if>><span class="green">你借鹿角坠清音引来了守林信鸽的秘藏铜管。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<skulduggery 1>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回石柱群 (0:12)|MP Region Druid Pillars]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<<else>>
	林间湿风吹斜了艾草青烟，呛得你呼吸微乱。<span class="red">你转过身背风平复气息。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[贴近再熏暖鹿角 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Antler 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回古石环 (0:12)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>
<br>
<<mpsewicon>><<link [[继续查探 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Antler 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Keepsake Use Mask 4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "brothel">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night" or Time.dayState is "dusk">>灯火摇曳的天鹅绒暗层镜面试衣沙龙内，<<else>>帷幔低垂的天鹅绒暗层丝绒假面回廊尽头，<</if>>你取出精巧冷冽的纯银狐面胸针，看到三面交错的试衣落地铜镜边框上刻着一只唯有狐面折光才能对准的银丝锁眼，镜台边放着一面小折镜与一块绒面擦银布。<<if $mpKeepsake and $mpKeepsake["keepsake_velvet_mask"]>>纯银狐面的双瞳嵌着两粒细小的反光棱晶。<</if>>

<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:08)|MP Region Velvet Mirage]]>><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpKs4_mask is 1>>
试衣铜镜边框的银丝锁眼今日已借狐面胸针开启过，暗屉合拢无痕。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-keepsake-use-mask-4">
<<keepsakeicon>><<link "拭亮狐面 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-mask-4">>
<<if ($seductionskill or 0) gte 250 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 260>>
	<<set $daily.mpKs4_mask to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks4_mask_rew")>><<money 480>>双瞳折光精准落入锁眼，镜台暗屉悄然弹开，露出一叠贵宾沙龙的私密打赏金券。<<else>>双瞳棱晶在暖光下折射出迷人光斑，镜台机关运转得丝滑无声。<</if>><span class="green">你借纯银狐面胸针开启了试衣铜镜的折光暗屉。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回暗层 (0:08)|MP Region Velvet Mirage]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<<else>>
	丝绒帷幔被穿堂风吹动，挡了一下投向锁眼的光束。<span class="red">你将帷幔钩在黄铜挂钩上。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[扶墙再拭亮狐面 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Mask 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回暗层 (0:08)|MP Region Velvet Mirage]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<spaicon "massage">><<link "借镜反光 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-mask-4">>
<<if ($danceskill or 0) gte 250 or ($science or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpKs4_mask to 1>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["clue_ks4_mask"]>><<set $mpClues["clue_ks4_mask"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks4_mask_rew_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>双重光束同时点亮镜框顶端的暗扣，内侧挂袋滑出，奉上一笔丰厚的演出纪念信物。<<else>>双重折光在三面铜镜间勾勒出精妙的几何光路，令你暗暗称奇。<</if>><span class="green">你用双重反射法解开了镜框顶端的隐藏挂袋。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<skulduggery 1>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回假面回廊 (0:08)|MP Region Velvet Masque]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<<else>>
	小折镜底座在光滑大理石台面上滑了半寸，光斑偏离了靶心。<span class="red">你垫上一块丝绒巾稳住折镜。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[垫布再借镜反光 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Mask 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回暗层 (0:08)|MP Region Velvet Mirage]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>
<br>
<<mpclockworkicon>><<link [[继续查探 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Mask 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Keepsake Use Lens 4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night" or Time.dayState is "dusk">>星辉洒满旧学园天文翼楼标本陈列暗阁的高窗，<<else>>阳光斜照的旧学园天文翼楼星图档案室窗台前，<</if>>你取出澄澈无瑕的消色差古透镜，发现陈列柜中央那方古陨石切片台上方设有一支可旋入副镜片的黄铜检偏筒，旁边放着一盏钠光灯与一把鹿皮刷。<<if $mpKeepsake and $mpKeepsake["keepsake_observatory_lens"]>>消色差古透镜在光下呈现出淡蓝色的镀膜微光。<</if>>

<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:08)|MP Region Observatory Wing]]>><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpKs4_lens is 1>>
古陨石切片台的黄铜检偏筒今日已借消色差古透镜观测完毕。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-keepsake-use-lens-4">
<<keepsakeicon>><<link "旋入镜筒 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-lens-4">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 260 or ($maths or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpKs4_lens to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks4_lens_rew")>><<money 460>>陨石切片内部浮现出清晰的干涉星纹，展台底匣随之开启，露出一卷学园皇家观测基金银券。<<else>>干涉星纹在消色差透镜下纤毫毕现，你顺手将星纹角度记入笔记。<</if>><span class="green">你借消色差古透镜看清了陨石切片的干涉星纹。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回天文翼楼 (0:08)|MP Region Observatory Wing]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<<else>>
	检偏筒外圈的调焦环略紧，第一次旋入没能对准焦平面。<span class="red">你放松固定螺丝半圈再调。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[缓气再旋入镜筒 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Lens 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回天文翼楼 (0:08)|MP Region Observatory Wing]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<techicon "lightbulb">><<link "投射晶格 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-lens-4">>
<<if ($history or 0) gte 260 or ($english or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpKs4_lens to 1>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["clue_ks4_lens"]>><<set $mpClues["clue_ks4_lens"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks4_lens_rew_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>晶格图谱精准投射在墙面刻度板上，暗格自动弹开，奉上一笔校董会特别学术纪念铜章。<<else>>钠光单色光束穿过透镜与陨石切片，在墙面上映出瑰丽的晶格光斑。<</if>><span class="green">古陨石切片的完整晶格图谱映在墙面上。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<skulduggery 1>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回折光穹顶 (0:08)|MP Region Observatory Dome]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<<else>>
	钠光灯预热尚未稳定，光斑亮度忽明忽暗。<span class="red">你耐心地等灯管发光稳定。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[凝目再投射晶格 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Lens 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回天文翼楼 (0:08)|MP Region Observatory Wing]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>
<br>
<<mpmapicon>><<link [[继续查探 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Lens 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

